# Copy to .env for local dev. Astro/Vite only exposes PUBLIC_-prefixed vars
# to client-side code, and inlines them at build time -- so this must also
# be set as a build-time env var on Railway (or wherever it's deployed).
#
# Use a Mapbox token scoped to this project's domains (localhost, Railway
# preview/prod, epiport.org), not the token from the old Squarespace site --
# that one is tied to its own usage/billing and domain restrictions.
PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
